   Correct.  Giants will be randomly generated, however.  Polymorphing
into a giant and bringing some boulders can help.  Note: Randomly
generated boulders don't seem to stack.  (Each boulder takes up a
separate inventory slot.)

   Reverse genociding giant/large/plain mimics on Astral can also work.
Use spell/wand of sleep to "freeze" them into the correct position.
Kill those that are badly located.  Carry their corpses to a more useful
location.  Zap with wand/spell of undead turning.  Then sleep them with
wand/spell.  (Intrinsic protection against shape changers is useful.)


